{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_069580","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"给Metal Gear搭载核武……没想到你会这么配合。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"事到如今，怎么突然说这个？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，这对我们来说帮了大忙……但你真的没问题吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"虽说是为了MSF自卫，可那终究还是核武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"本质上和你讨厌的Peace Walker是一样的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……问题就在这里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这里？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你不会遮遮掩掩，而是把事实直接说出来。这就是你和CIA那帮人的不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不像那些一开始甜言蜜语地接近你，一到关键时刻就翻脸的家伙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……我只是说实话而已。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"正因为是你，我才觉得你不会拿它做蠢事……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"说白了，就是我相信你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你太高看我了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"是吗？而且，双足步行技术也不只是为了开发兵器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"如果能把它小型化，也可以应用到机器人和义肢上。那样的话，我也能自由行走了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯，是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我想靠自己的力量，战胜自己的命运。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"如果我说，为了这个目标，我也想借用你的力量……你会生气吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"不会。这是公平的交易。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"谢谢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"当然，人是会变的……但我相信。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"Snake，我相信你会一直是现在的你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""}]}